  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>메<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>삐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby> <ruby>메<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>삐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tnp0DySxH7s?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>藏<rt>창ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>心內<rt>심ˉ래ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>細膩<rt>쇠ˋ띠-</rt></ruby><ruby>拍<rt>팧ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>見<rt>길</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chàng-ti-sīm-lāi’e lì kâm-e-bo-soè-ri-phâh-m-kḭ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>覕<rt>삫ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>厝內<rt>추ˋ래ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>想<rt>슐ˉ</rt></ruby>’릐 <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>斟酌<rt>짐ˉ젹ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>臆<rt>욯</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>心意<rt>심ˉ이</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bîh-ti-chù-lāi siṵ̄’li goà jīm-jiôrk-yoh’tio lì’e sīm-i\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>Maybe<rt>메ˉ삐ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>Maybe<rt>메ˉ삐ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>每<rt>뮈ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一个<rt>짇에-</rt></ruby><ruby>暗暝<rt>암ˋ미ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    mē-bî mē-bî mûi-jit-e-àm-mí\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>甘<rt>감ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>照顧<rt>ᄌᆤˋ거</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kâm-kông-lì e-m-kâm gùn bo-láng jiàu-kor\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>若<rt>나-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>生活<rt>솅ˉ왛ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>哪<rt>나ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>遮邇<rt>쟣ˆ니-</rt></ruby><ruby>艱苦<rt>간ˉ커ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    na-bo-lì’e siēng-oâh nà e-jiâh-ni-kān-khòr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>愛<rt>애</rt></ruby>’릐 <ruby>含<rt>감-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>喙邊<rt>취ˋ빌ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>定定<rt>댤댤-</rt></ruby><ruby>吞<rt>툰ˆ</rt></ruby>’롷킈\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ai’li kam-ti-chùi-pḭ̂ tia̰-tia̰-thûn’loh-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>將<rt>졍ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>聲音<rt>샬ˉ임ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>留<rt>ᄅᅷ-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"jît\">這<rt>짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>座<rt>조-</rt></ruby><ruby>城市<rt>샬치ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jiōng-lì’e siā̰-îm lau-ti-jît-jo-sia̰-chī\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>藏<rt>창ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>心內<rt>심ˉ래ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>細膩<rt>쇠ˋ띠-</rt></ruby><ruby>拍<rt>팧ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>見<rt>길</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chàng-ti-sīm-lāi’e lì kâm-e-bo-soè-ri-phâh-m-kḭ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>覕<rt>삫ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>厝內<rt>추ˋ래ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>想<rt>슐ˉ</rt></ruby>’릐 <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>斟酌<rt>짐ˉ젹ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>臆<rt>욯</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>心意<rt>심ˉ이</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bîh-ti-chù-lāi siṵ̄’li goà jīm-jiôrk-yoh’tio lì’e sīm-i\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>Maybe<rt>메ˉ삐ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>Maybe<rt>메ˉ삐ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>花<rt>훼ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>謝<rt>샤ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>開<rt>퀴ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    mē-bî mē-bî huê siā ma-e-khûi\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>甘<rt>감ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>照顧<rt>ᄌᆤˋ거</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kâm-kông-lì e-m-kâm gùn bo-láng jiàu-kor\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>若<rt>나-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>生活<rt>솅ˉ왛ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>哪<rt>나ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>遮邇<rt>쟣ˆ니-</rt></ruby><ruby>艱苦<rt>간ˉ커ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    na-bo-lì’e siēng-oâh nà e-jiâh-ni-kān-khòr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>愛<rt>애</rt></ruby>’릐 <ruby>含<rt>감-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>喙邊<rt>취ˋ빌ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>定定<rt>댤댤-</rt></ruby><ruby>吞<rt>툰ˆ</rt></ruby>’롷킈\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ai’li kam-ti-chùi-pḭ̂ tia̰-tia̰-thûn’loh-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>分開<rt>훈ˉ퀴ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>了後<rt>ᄅᆤˆᄋᅷˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>將<rt>졍ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>이<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby>當做<rt>덩ˉ죄ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>秘密<rt>비ˋ삗ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hūn-khūi-liâu-āu gùn jiōng-ī tōng-joè-pì-bît\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>凡勢<rt>환세</rt></ruby> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>甘<rt>감ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>照顧<rt>ᄌᆤˋ거</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hoan-se lì e-m-kâm gùn bo-láng jiàu-kor\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一个<rt>짇에-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>生活<rt>솅ˉ왛ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>過<rt>궤</rt></ruby>’ᄅᆤ <ruby>誠好<rt>쟐호ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jit-e-láng’e siēng-oâh goà ma-kue’liau jia̰-hò\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>開始<rt>캐ˉ시ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>愛<rt>애ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>自己<rt>주기ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>也<rt>야-</rt></ruby><ruby>敢<rt>갈ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>愛<rt>애</rt></ruby>’릐\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khāi-sî-ài-goâ-ju-kī ya-kâ̰-kông-ai’li\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>將<rt>졍ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>聲音<rt>샬ˉ임ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>留<rt>ᄅᅷ-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"jît\">這<rt>짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>座<rt>조-</rt></ruby><ruby>城市<rt>샬치ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jiōng-gùn’e siā̰-îm lau-ti-jît-jo-sia̰-chī\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n"
